#: content/_index.md:0
msgid "Xfce Desktop Environment"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: content/_index.md:0 content/_index.md:15 content/about/_index.md:6
msgid "Xfce is a lightweight desktop environment for UNIX-like operating systems. It aims to be fast and low on system resources, while still being visually appealing and user friendly."
msgstr "Xfce es un environament de burèu leugièr pels sistèmas operatius d'estil UNIX. Visa a èsser rapid e utilizar pas gaire de ressorsas del sistèma, tot en essent visualament atractiu e convivial."

#: content/_index.md:0
msgid "desktop environment, window manager, desktop, speed, lightweight, gtk+, open source, xforms common environment"
msgstr ""

