#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/news/1734220800.md:7
msgid "After almost two years of work, we are happy to announce the release of Xfce 4.20 !"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/news/1734220800.md:11
msgid "Since Xfce 4.18 a lot of major development happened. Our team added many nice new features, did a gazillion of bug fixes and did various minor improvements. Finally, all that was released for your pleasure."
