#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/about/tour44.md:0
msgid "Xfce 4.4 tour"
msgstr "Visita Xfce 4.4"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour44.md:7
msgid "As of today, the long awaited version 4.4.0 of the Xfce Desktop Environment is finally available. I will try to highlight some of the new features which have been added since the last stable release."
msgstr "À compter d'uèi, la tant attendue version 4.4.0 de l'environament de burèu Xfce es enfin disponible. Je vais essayer de metre en évidence qualques-unes dels novèlas foncionalitats que son estadas apondudas dempuèi la darrièra version establa."

#. type: Title ##
#: content/about/tour44.md:9
msgid "Desktop Icons"
msgstr "Icònas del burèu"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour44.md:11
msgid "One of the most often requested features during the 4.0 and 4.2 was support for icons on the desktop. Now, with Xfce 4.4.0, this feature was finally added to the desktop manager **Xfdesktop**."
msgstr "Una de las caracteristicas lo mai sovent demandés pendent la 4.0 e la 4.2 es estada lo soutien dels icònas sul burèu. Ara, amb Xfce 4.4.0, aquesta fonction a finalament été apondut al gestionari de burèu <b>Xfdesktop</b>."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour44.md:13
msgid "![Desktop Icons][img-desktop-icons]"
msgstr "![Icònas del burèu][img-desktop-icons]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour44.md:15
msgid "The desktop manager utilizes **Thunar**'s libraries to handle application launchers and regular files/folders on the desktop. The desktop manager is also able to display icons for minimized windows on the desktop, which is quite a popular feature from the CDE world. Of course, you can disable the desktop icons altogether if you prefer a clean desktop."
msgstr "Lo gestionari de burèu utiliza las bibliotècas<b>Thunar</b>per manipular d'aviadors d'aplicacions e de fichièrs / dorsièrs regulars sul burèu. Lo gestionari de burèu es tanben capable d'afichar las icònas de las fenèstras redusidas sul burèu, aquò's una caracteristica populara dins lo monde de CDE. Solide, podètz desactivar totalament las icònas del burèu se vos agrada mai un burèu pròpri."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour44.md:17
msgid "![Desktop Settings][img-desktop-settings]"
msgstr "![Paramètres del burèu][img-desktop-settings]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour44.md:19
msgid "**Xfdesktop** also continues to provide access to the applications menu, as it did in the previous Xfce releases."
msgstr "<b>Xfdesktop</b> contunha tanben de provesir l'accès al menú aplicacions, coma l'a fait dins las versions precedentas de Xfce."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour44.md:23
msgid "The desktop icon support goes hand in hand with the new file manager [Thunar](http://thunar.xfce.org/) which replaces the previous file manager **Xffm**."
msgstr "Lo supòrt de las icònas del burèu va de cotria amb lo novèl gestionari de fichièrs [Thunar](http://thunar.xfce.org/) que remplaça lo gestionari de fichièrs precedent <b>xffm</b >."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour44.md:25
msgid "![Thunar File Manager][img-thunar]"
msgstr "![Gestionari de fichièrs Thunar][img-thunar]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour44.md:27
msgid "**Thunar** was written from scratch to provide an easy to use, but still very lightweight file manager for Xfce. Its user interface was designed to look similar to the file chooser which was introduced with GTK+ 2.4, and other file managers such as **Nautilus** and **pcmanfm** already picked up that idea as well."
msgstr "<b>Thunar</b> es estat escrich a partir de zèro per provesir una aisina de bon utilizar, mas un gestionari de fichièrs fòrça leugièr per Xfce. Son interfàcia d'utilizaire es estada concebuda per la combinar amb l'explorador de fichièr qu'es estat introdusit amb GTK + 2.4, e d'autres gestionaris de fichièrs tals coma <b>Nautilus</b> e <b>pcmanfm</b> an ja représ aquesta idèa tanben."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour44.md:29
msgid "**Thunar** supports all the file management functionality which users will expect, and also several advanced features. For example, a so-called *Bulk Renamer* is included which allows users to rename multiple files at once using a certain criterion."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour44.md:31
msgid "![Thunar Bulk Rename][img-thunar-bulk-rename]"
msgstr "![Renomenar en massa amb Thunar][img-thunar-bulk-rename]"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/about/tour44.md:33
msgid "Removable Drives and Media"
msgstr "Lectors e supòrts amovibles"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour44.md:35
msgid "Xfce 4.4.0 provides easy access to data on removable drives and media. Just insert the media into the drive or plug the new drive in to the computer and an icon representing the removable volume will appear on the desktop and in **Thunar**'s side pane."
msgstr "Xfce 4.4.0 provesís un accès aisit a las donadas suls lectors e supòrts amovibles. Sufís d'inserir lo supòrt dins lo lector o de brancar lo novèl lector a l'ordenador e una icòna que representa lo volum amovible apareis sul burèu e dins lo panèl lateral de <b>Thunar</b>."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour44.md:37
msgid "![Removable Volumes][img-removable-volumes]"
msgstr "![Volums amovibles][img-removable-volumes]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour44.md:39
msgid "Click on the icon to automatically mount the volume. Right-click the icon to unmount the drive or eject the media from the drive. Note however that this feature requires [HAL](https://freedesktop.org/wiki/Software_2fhal) and is therefore only available for Linux 2.6.x and FreeBSD 6.x and above at the time of this writing (there is limited removable media support for FreeBSD 4.x and 5.x which does not require HAL)."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: content/about/tour44.md:41
msgid "Text Editor"
msgstr "Editor de tèxte"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour44.md:43
msgid "The new text editor **MousePad** is included with this release. **MousePad** provides all the basic editor functionality, nothing more, nothing less."
msgstr "Lo novèl editor de tèxte <b>MousePad</b> es inclús amb aquesta version. <b>MousePad</b> provesís totas las foncionalitats de l'editor de basa, res mai, res mens."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour44.md:45
msgid "![MousePad][img-mousepad]"
msgstr "![MousePad][img-mousepad]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour44.md:47
msgid "You can think of **MousePad** as the equivalent to **NotePad** on Windows. It starts up very fast, usually in less than one second, even on older systems."
msgstr "Podètz pensar a <b>MousePad</b> coma equivalent del <b>blòtnòtas</b>sus Windows. S'avia fòrça rapidament, generalament en mens d'una segonda, quitament sus de sistèmas mai ancians."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour44.md:51
msgid "**Xfwm4** continues to be the window manager of the hearts."
msgstr "<b>Xfwm4 </b> contunha d'èsser lo còr del gestionari de fenèstras ."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour44.md:53
msgid "![Xfwm4 ARGB32][img-xfwm4-argb32]"
msgstr "![Xfwm4 ARGB32][img-xfwm4-argb32]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour44.md:55
msgid "This release features an enhanced compositor, supporting transparent ARGB windows, shadows, window frame transparency and much more."
msgstr "Aquesta version dispausa d'un melhor composidor, en sostenent de fenèstras transparentas ARGB, d'ombras, la transparéncia del quadre de la fenèstra e plan mai encara."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour44.md:57
msgid "![Xfwm4 Switcher][img-xfwm4-switcher]"
msgstr "![Xfwm4 Switcher][img-xfwm4-switcher]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour44.md:59
msgid "**Xfwm4** also includes a brand new application switcher, as shown in the screenshot above, which displays all windows from the current workspace with icons and window titles."
msgstr "<b>Xfwm4</b> inclutz tanben un novèl selector d'aplicacion, coma lo fa veire la captura d'ecran çaisús, qu'aficha totas las fenèstras de l'espaci de trabalh amb d'icònas e de títols de fenèstras."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour44.md:61
msgid "![Xfwm4 Themes][img-xfwm4-themes]"
msgstr "![Tèmas Xfwm4][img-xfwm4-themes]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour44.md:63
msgid "Further on support for multiple image formats for window decoration themes was added, including `PNG`, `GIF` and `SVG` images."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour44.md:65
msgid "![Xfwm4 Tweaks][img-xfwm4-tweaks]"
msgstr "![Tweaks Xfwm4][img-xfwm4-tweaks]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour44.md:67
msgid "Advanced controls for the window manager were also added, allowing thorough tweaking of window behavior."
msgstr "Las comandas avançadas pel gestionari de fenèstras tanben son estadas apondudas, que permeton d'afinar d'un biais aprigondit lo comportament de la fenèstra."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour44.md:71
msgid "The **Xfce4-panel** was completely rewritten for the Xfce 4.4 release. Multiple panels are supported *out of the box* now and can easily be configured using the new **Panel Manager** shown in the screenshot below."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour44.md:73
msgid "![Panel Manager][img-panel-manager]"
msgstr "![Gestionari de panèl][img-panel-manager]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour44.md:75
msgid "One of the major problems in previous Xfce releases was that every plugin had to be run in the same process as the panel, and hence every plugin was able to crash the whole panel. To address this issue, support for external plugins was added to the panel."
msgstr "Un dels problèmas màgers dins los comunicats de Xfce precedent èra que cada empeuton deviá èsser executat dins lo meteis processus que lo panèl, e doncas cada empeuton es estada en mesura de blocar l'ensemble del panèl. Per resòlvre aqueste problèma, lo supòrt dels empeutons externes es estada apondut al panèl."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour44.md:77
msgid "![Panel Add Item Dialog][img-panel-additem]"
msgstr "![Panèl fenèstra Apondre article][img-panel-additem]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour44.md:79
msgid "Developers of panel plugins can now decide whether the plugin should run as external process or as part of the panel process, depending on the stability of the plugin."
msgstr "Los desvolopaires d'empeutons del panèl pòdon ara decidir se l'empeuton deuriá fonctionner coma un processus extèrne o dins lo quadre de la procedura de grop especial, en foncion de l'estabilitat de l'empeuton."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour44.md:81
msgid "![Panel Icon Box Plugin][img-panel-iconbox]"
msgstr "![Panèl empeuton bóstia d'Icòna][img-panel-iconbox]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour44.md:83
msgid "Since there is now support for multiple panels, the separate **Xftaskbar4** and **Xfce4-iconbox** utilities are no longer required. Instead, both the taskbar and the iconbox are available as panel plugins now."
msgstr "Coma il es d'ara enlà en carga de plusieurs panèls, los utilitaris separats <b>Xftaskbar4</b> e <b>Xfce4-iconbox</b> son pas mai necessaris. Al lieu de aquò, a la fois la barra dels prètzfaits e la bóstia a icònas son disponibles sous forme d'un empeuton del panèl ara."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour44.md:85
msgid "Most of the additional panel plugins, available via the [Xfce Goodies Project](https://goodies.xfce.org/), have been updated for the new panel, and several new plugins were added. For example, the brand new **xfce4-xfapplet-plugin** allows users to add GNOME panel applets to the Xfce panel."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: content/about/tour44.md:87
msgid "Time Management"
msgstr "Gestion del temps"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour44.md:89
msgid "The new time management application **Orage** replaces the **Xfcalendar**, which was introduced with Xfce 4.2.0. **Orage** provides several features to efficiently manage your time."
msgstr "La novèla aplicacion de gestion del temps <b>Orage</b> remplace <b>xfcalendar</b>, que es estada introduit amb Xfce 4.2.0. <b>Orage</b> fournit plusieurs foncionalitats per gerir efficacement votre temps."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour44.md:91
msgid "![Orage][img-orage]"
msgstr "![Orage][img-orage]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour44.md:93
msgid "While **Orage** is very lightweight and easy to use, it supports all the important features found in larger calendar applications like **Outlook** or **Evolution**. While **Xfcalendar** used the custom `dbh` format in the past to store your settings, **Orage** is based on `ical` and therefore compatible with other calendar applications."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: content/about/tour44.md:95
msgid "Terminal Emulator"
msgstr "Emulator de terminal"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour44.md:97
msgid "While **Terminal** was already available during the 4.2 days, it was not mature enough at that time to be part of the core. With this major release, it was moved into the core desktop."
msgstr "Alors que lo <b>Terminal</b> èra ja disponible pendent los 4,2 jours, il n'était pas assez mature a aqueste moment de far partie del còr. Amb aquesta version majeure, il es estada desplaçat dins lo còr del burèu."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour44.md:99
msgid "![Terminal][img-terminal]"
msgstr "![Terminal][img-terminal]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour44.md:101
msgid "Besides the basic features which you might expect from a terminal emulator, it includes some nice additional features, like multiple tabs per window, customizable toolbars and the ability to configure nearly every aspect of the application via *hidden options*. As can be seen in the screenshot above, this release also supports real transparency using **Xfwm4**'s integrated composition manager."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: content/about/tour44.md:103
msgid "Printing"
msgstr "Impression en cors..."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour44.md:105
msgid "**Xfprint**, the Xfce printing management application, saw several small improvements with this release. First, the `a2ps` converter is not mandatory anymore, whilst still recommended. Support for `CUPS` 1.2 was added and **Xfprint** is now able to display the printer state with the `CUPS`-backend."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour44.md:107
msgid "![Xfce Printing][img-xfprint]"
msgstr "![Impression de Xfce][img-xfprint]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour44.md:109
msgid "**Xfprint** also integrates with **MousePad** to provide generic printing support for different kinds of text documents using the `a2ps` converter."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour44.md:111
msgid "![Xfce Print Dialog][img-xfprint-dialog]"
msgstr "![Bóstia de dialòg imprimer Xfce][img-xfprint-dialog]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour44.md:113
msgid "As you can see the print dialog still looks relatively similar to that of Xfce 4.2, but the internal workings of the printing support were improved, especially the `CUPS` support. Besides that, the printing management functionality was moved to a library, so other applications can use the API to access the printer configuration."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: content/about/tour44.md:115
msgid "Autostart"
msgstr "Aviada automatica"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour44.md:117
msgid "Xfce 4.4.0 implements the new [Autostart Specification](https://freedesktop.org/wiki/Standards_2fautostart_2dspec) - actually Xfce was the first desktop to implement said feature, but the others were faster to release. ;-)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour44.md:119
msgid "![Xfce Autostart Editor][img-autostart]"
msgstr "![Editor de aviada automatica Xfce][img-autostart]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour44.md:121
msgid "The specification consists of two parts, the *Autostart of Applications During Startup*, which is implemented in **xfce4-session** and the *Autostart Of Applications After Mount* which is implemented in [thunar-volman](http://foo-projects.org/~benny/projects/thunar-volman/index.html). This release also includes the **xfce4-autostart-editor**, shown in the screenshot above, which allows users to easily add, remove or disable autostarted applications."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour44.md:125
msgid "This release introduces new options to customize the desktop to your needs. Some examples of new settings dialogs were already shown in the sections above."
msgstr "Aquesta version introduit de novèlas opcions per personalizar lo burèu a vos besoins. Qualques exemples de novèlas fenèstras de paramètres son estats ja présentés dins las seccions precedentas."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour44.md:127
msgid "![Preferred Applications][img-preferences-applications]"
msgstr "![Aplicacions preferidas][img-preferences-applications]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour44.md:129
msgid "The preferred applications framework, which was previously only available in **Terminal**, was imported into Xfce, so users no longer need to edit shell profiles to specify which browser and terminal emulator should be used by Xfce applications. The goal was to make it as easy as possible to change an application for a certain category (GNOME users may have already noticed that GNOME adopted this approach, because it is such simple)."
msgstr "Lo quadre d'aplicacions preferit, que èra de per abans unicament disponible en <b>Terminal</b>, es estada importat dins Xfce, per tal que los utilizaires ajan pas mai besonh de modificar los perfils shell per préciser quel navigador e emulator de terminal deu èsser utilizada per las aplicacions Xfce. Lo but èra de lo rendre tant aisit coma possible per modificar una aplicacion per una certana categoria (utilizaires de GNOME an benlèu ja remarcat que GNOME a adopté aquesta approche, parce qu'il es se simple)."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour44.md:131
msgid "![Keyboard Shortcuts][img-preferences-keyboard]"
msgstr "![Acorchis clavièr][img-preferences-keyboard]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour44.md:133
msgid "And then there was the problem with the keyboard shortcuts in Xfce 4.2... Xfce 4.2 limited the number of freely available keyboard shortcuts, while people wanted to assign any number of keyboard shortcuts. With Xfce 4.4 this limitation is history and the application shortcuts are now separated from the window manager shortcuts."
msgstr "E puèi i a eu lo problèma amb los acorchis de clavièr dins Xfce 4.2 ... Xfce 4.2 limite lo nombre d'acorchis de clavièr librement disponibles, mentre que lo monde voulaient atribuir un certan nombre d'acorchis de clavièr. Amb Xfce 4.4 aquesta limitacion es una histoire anciana e los acorchis d'aplicacions son d'ara enlà separats dels acorchis del gestionari de fenèstras."

#. type: Title ##
#: content/about/tour44.md:135
msgid "Feedback"
msgstr "Retour"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour44.md:137
msgid "Please post comments on this article in my [blog](http://xfce-diary.blogspot.com/2007/01/visual-tour-of-xfce-440.html) and use the [xfce](/community/lists) mailinglist if you have questions about Xfce 4.4.0 or trouble with the installation."
msgstr "Se vos plai, daissatz vòstres comentaris sus aqueste article dins mon [blog](http://xfce-diary.blogspot.com/2007/01/visual-tour-of-xfce-440.html) e utilizar la lista de difusion [xfce](/community/lists)se avètz de questions a prepaus de Xfce 4.4.0 o de problèmas amb l'installacion."

#. type: Title ##
#: content/about/tour44.md:139 content/about/tour46.md:137
msgid "Links"
msgstr "Ligams"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/about/tour44.md:141 content/about/tour46.md:139
msgid "[Xfce website](https://xfce.org/)"
msgstr "[Site Web Xfce](https://xfce.org/)"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/about/tour44.md:142
msgid "[Thunar website](http://thunar.xfce.org/)"
msgstr "[Site Web Thunar](http://thunar.xfce.org/)"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/about/tour44.md:144 content/about/tour46.md:142
msgid "Credits"
msgstr "Crédits"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour44.md:146
msgid "Written by Benedikt Meurer, 21 Jan 2007"
msgstr "Écrit per Benedikt Meurer, 21 Jan 2007"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/about/tour46.md:0
msgid "Xfce 4.6 tour"
msgstr "Visita Xfce 4.6"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour46.md:7
msgid "The long awaited 4.6.0 version of the Xfce Desktop Environment is finally available. We will try to highlight some of the new features which have been added since the last stable release."
msgstr "Lo tant attendu la version 4.6.0 de l'environament de burèu Xfce es enfin disponible. Nous allons essayer de metre en évidence qualques-unes dels novèlas foncionalitats que son estadas apondudas dempuèi la darrièra version establa."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour46.md:11
msgid "Since desktop icons have been introduced in Xfce 4.4, people have expressed the need to allow the selection of multiple icons (rubber banding). With **Xfce 4.6**, the **Xfdesktop** manager finally implements this feature: you can select multiple icons, remove them, etcetera..."
msgstr "Depuis que las icònas del burèu son estadas introduites dins Xfce 4.4, lo monde an exprimé la nécessité de permetre la seleccion de plusieurs icònas (seleccion élastique). Amb <b>Xfce 4.6</b>, lo gestionari <b>Xfdesktop</b>met en òbra enfin aquesta foncionalitat : podètz seleccionar mantuna icòna, las suprimir, etc ..."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour46.md:13
msgid "![Multiple icons selection][img-xfdesktop-rubberbanding]"
msgstr "![Seleccion dels icònas multiples][img-xfdesktop-rubberbanding]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour46.md:15
msgid "**Xfce 4.6** features a brand new desktop menu which allows you to manipulate files as with the **Thunar** filemanager contextual menu, but also to open applications, exit your session, or access the help documentation."
msgstr "<b>Xfce 4.6</b> prepausa una novèla version del menú del burèu  que vos permet de manipular de fichièrs coma amb lo gestionari de fichièrs del menú contextual <b>Thunar</b>, mas tanben per dobrir d'aplicacions, quitar vòstra session, o d'accedir amb l'ajuda documentacion."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour46.md:17
msgid "![New desktop menu][img-xfdesktop-menu]"
msgstr "![Novèl menú del burèu][img-xfdesktop-menu]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour46.md:21
msgid "A lot of long standing bugs have been fixed in **Xfce4 Panel**, particularly for multiple screen setups, but this new release also brings an improved set of panel plugins."
msgstr "Un grand nombre de bugs de longa data son estats corregits dins <b>panèl Xfce4</b>, en particular pels configuracions a plusieurs ecrans, mas aquesta novèla version apporte tanben un ensemble melhorat del panèl dels empeutons"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour46.md:23
msgid "![New binary clock][img-xfce4-panel-clock]"
msgstr "![Novèl relòtge binari][img-xfce4-panel-clock]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour46.md:25
msgid "The **clock plugin** has been rewritten to consume fewer system resources and to fix some display bugs, but there is also a new clock mode for the geek in you: binary clock! The new **notification area plugin** allows you to hide selected notification icons to keep your notification area clean and readable."
msgstr "Lo <b>empeuton relòtge</b> es estada reescrich per consomenar mens de ressorsas sistèma e corregir qualques bugs d'afichatge, mas i a tanben un novèl mòde de relòtge pel geek en vous : relòtge binaire ! Lo novèl <b>empeuton de la zòna de notificacion</b> vos permet d'amagar las icònas de notificacion seleccionats per gardar votre zòna de notificacion pròpria e lisible."

#. type: Title ##
#: content/about/tour46.md:27
msgid "Sound Mixer *(xfce4-mixer)*"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour46.md:29
msgid "**Xfce4 Mixer** has been rewritten from scratch to use [Gstreamer](https://gstreamer.freedesktop.org/). This allows us to more easily support multiple sound systems, the user interface is more polished, and you can manage several different sound cards. Additionally, a panel plugin allows you to set the system sound quickly using the mouse scroll wheel."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour46.md:31
msgid "![New sound mixer][img-xfce4-mixer]"
msgstr "![Novèl mesclador sonòr][img-xfce4-mixer]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour46.md:35
msgid "**Xfce 4.6** comes with an enhanced session manager: your session should be started faster, and the settings dialog has been reworked to ease the management of session-aware applications. Additionally, the session manager will now automatically restart session applications which crashed so that you are not left without a desktop, panel, window manager, etcetera, if a crash occurs."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour46.md:37
msgid "![Session settings dialog][img-xfce4-session-settings]"
msgstr "![Session dels paramètres de dialòg][img-xfce4-session-settings]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour46.md:39
msgid "The session manager also includes a new long-awaited feature: support for **suspend** and **hibernate** \"out of the box.\" The logout dialog now has two additional buttons which offer to suspend or hibernate your computer."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour46.md:41
msgid "![Session logout dialog][img-xfce4-session-logout]"
msgstr "![Session desconnexion dialòg][img-xfce4-session-logout]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour46.md:45
msgid "As usual, **Xfwm4** has matured quite a bit during this release cycle: many bugs have been fixed, support for multiple displays has been added, and overall performance has been improved."
msgstr "Coma d'habitude, <b>Xfwm4</b> a muri un peu al cors d'aqueste cicle de version : de nombreux bugs son estats corregits, lo supòrt de plusieurs ecrans es estada apondut, e la performància globale es estada melhorada."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour46.md:47
msgid "In addition to some other new features, **Xfwm4** is now able to detect windows that do not respond and offer to terminate them."
msgstr "En mai de qualques autres novèlas foncionalitats, <b>Xfwm4</b> es ara capable de détecter las fenèstras que ne répondent pas e proposent d'y metre fin."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour46.md:49
msgid "![Dialog to terminate busy applications][img-xfwm4-net-ping]"
msgstr "![Dialòg per metre fin a d'aplicacions ocupadas][img-xfwm4-net-ping]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour46.md:51
msgid "There is also a new **actions menu** which allows you to quickly move and resize windows, put them above or below other windows, or fullscreen them."
msgstr "Tanben i a un novèl <b>menú actions</b>  que vos permet de desplaçar rapidament e redimensionar las fenèstras, de las metre en dessús o en dejós dels autres fenèstras, o en ecran complet."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour46.md:53
msgid "![New actions menu][img-xfwm4-new-menu]"
msgstr "![Novèl menú d'accions][img-xfwm4-new-menu]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour46.md:55
msgid "A new **fill** operation has been implemented; it expands a given window to the available space without overlapping other adjacent windows."
msgstr "Una novèla operacion <b>remplir</b> es estada mesa en òbra, elle agrandit una fenèstra donada dins l'espace disponible sens chevauchement dels autres fenèstras adjacentes."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour46.md:57
msgid "![Fill operation][img-xfwm4-fill-operation]"
msgstr "![Emplenar operacion][img-xfwm4-fill-operation]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour46.md:59
msgid "The **compositor** has been optimized to reduce window flickering during resize operations."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour46.md:61
msgid "![Flicker free resizing][img-xfwm4-resize]"
msgstr "![Redimensionament liure Flicker][img-xfwm4-resize]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour46.md:63
msgid "Some **tweakable options** have also been added: for example, you can now disable the blinking of windows when they receive an urgency hint."
msgstr "Certaines <b> opcions per personalizar</b> an tanben été aponduts : per exemple, podètz ara desactivar lo clignotement de las fenèstras quand ils reçoivent un indicador d'urgence."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour46.md:65
msgid "![New tweakable options][img-xfwm4-new-tweaks]"
msgstr "![De novèlas opcions personalizablas][img-xfwm4-new-tweaks]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour46.md:69
msgid "There have been many bug fixes and performance improvements in **Thunar**. It can use the mouse forward and backward buttons (if available) to navigate, and it includes a new plugin that allows you to set an image as wallpaper from the context menu."
msgstr "I a eu de nombreuses correccions de bugs e melhoraments de performàncias dins <b>Thunar</b>. Il pòt utilizar los botons de la mirga vers l'avant e vers l'arrièr (si disponibles) per navigar, e il inclutz un novèl empeuton  que vos permet de definir un imatge coma fons d'ecran a partir del menú contextual."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour46.md:71
msgid "![Set an image in a Thunar folder as wallpaper][img-thunar-wallpaper-plugin]"
msgstr "![Definir un imatge dins un dorsièr Thunar coma fons d'ecran][img-thunar-wallpaper-plugin]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour46.md:73
msgid "**Thunar** now follows the [XDG user directories](https://freedesktop.org/wiki/Software/xdg-user-dirs) specification; this allows you to have themed and localized user folders to store your music, documents, videos, templates, etcetera..."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour46.md:75
msgid "![Thunar menu for user directories][img-thunar-xdg-user-dirs]"
msgstr "![Menú Thunar pels repertòris dels utilizaires][img-thunar-xdg-user-dirs]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour46.md:77
msgid "**Thunar** will now display a translucent icon for drives or volumes that are not mounted, so that you can distinguish them from the mounted ones."
msgstr "<b>Thunar</b> aficha ara una icòna translucida pels disques o los volums que son pas montats, de tal biais que los poscatz distinguir de los que son montats."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour46.md:79
msgid "![Translucent icons for unmounted drives and volumes][img-thunar-mounting]"
msgstr "![Icònas translucidas pels lectors e los volums demonitats][img-thunar-mounting]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour46.md:81
msgid "Last, but not least, **Thunar** now supports encrypted devices!"
msgstr "Darrièr punt, mas non lo moindre, <b>Thunar</b> supporte ara los periferics chifrats !"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour46.md:83
msgid "![Thunar support for encrypted devices][img-thunar-encrypted]"
msgstr "![Supòrt Thunar per periferics chifrats][img-thunar-encrypted]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour46.md:87
msgid "Xfce 4.6 features a new settings interface, **Xfce Settings Manager**, which allows you to configure your desktop environment much more easily than before. The dialogs which are accessible by single clicking on the icons have been designed to be more compact and to allow you to customize your desktop quickly and in a more intuitive way."
msgstr "Xfce 4.6 dispausa d'una novèla interfàcia de parametratge, lo <b>gestionari de paramètres Xfce</b>,  que vos permet de configurar votre environament de burèu beaucoup mai aisidament qu'de per abans. Les bóstia de dialògs que son accessibles en clicant sus ​​las icònas unicas son estats concebuts per èsser mai compactes e per vos permetre de personalizar vòstre burèu rapidament e de manière mai intuitiva."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour46.md:89
msgid "![Xfce4 Settings Manager][img-xfce4-settings-manager]"
msgstr "![Gestionari de paramètres Xfce4][img-xfce4-settings-manager]"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour46.md:91
msgid "Accessibility settings"
msgstr "Paramètres d'accessibilitat"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour46.md:93
msgid "![Accessibility settings dialog][img-xfce4-accessibility-settings]"
msgstr "![Bóstia de dialòg dels paramètres d'accessibilitat][img-xfce4-accessibility-settings]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour46.md:95
msgid "The **Accessibility settings** dialog allows you to set the accessibility related mouse and keyboard options, such as sticky keys, bounce keys, or mouse emulation."
msgstr "La fenèstra dels <b>paramètres d'accessibilitat</b> vos permet de definir las opcions del clavièr, telles que las tòcas rémanentes, las tòcas de rebomb, o l'émulation de la mirga mirga e sus l'accessibilitat."

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour46.md:97
msgid "Appearance settings"
msgstr "Paramètres d'aparéncia"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour46.md:99
msgid "![Appearance settings dialog][img-xfce4-appearance-settings]"
msgstr "![Bóstia de dialòg dels paramètres d'aparéncia][img-xfce4-appearance-settings]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour46.md:101
msgid "The **Appearance settings** dialog allows you to set the widget style, the icon theme, and font, toolbar and menu options."
msgstr "La bóstia de dialòg dels <b>paramètres d'aparéncia</b> vos permet de definir lo style del widget, lo tèma d'icònas e la poliça, de la barra d'aisinas e dels opcions del menú."

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour46.md:103
msgid "Display settings"
msgstr "Paramètres d'afichatge"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour46.md:105
msgid "![Display settings dialog][img-xfce4-display-settings]"
msgstr "![Afichar bóstia de dialòg paramètres][img-xfce4-display-settings]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour46.md:107
msgid "The **Display settings** dialog allows you to set the resolution, refresh rate, and the rotation for each screen that is connected."
msgstr "La fenèstra dels <b> paramètres d'afichatge </b> vos permet de definir la resolucion, frequéncia de refrescament e la rotacion per cada ecran que es connectat."

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour46.md:109
msgid "Keyboard settings"
msgstr "Paramètres del clavièr"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour46.md:111
msgid "![Keyboard settings dialog, layout tab][img-xfce4-keyboard-settings-layout]"
msgstr "![Fenèstra dels paramètres del Clavièr, onglet de presentacion][img-xfce4-keyboard-settings-layout]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour46.md:113
msgid "The **Keyboard settings** dialog allows you to set keyboard preferences such as key repeating, keyboard shortcuts, and your keyboard layout."
msgstr "La fenèstra dels <b>paramètres del clavièr</b> vos permet de definir dels preferéncias del clavièr telles que répétition dels tòcas , los acorchis de clavièr e la disposicion del clavièr."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour46.md:115
msgid "![Keyboard settings dialog, shortcuts tab][img-xfce4-keyboard-settings-shortcuts]"
msgstr "![Fenèstra dels paramètres del Clavièr, acorchis onglet][img-xfce4-keyboard-settings-shortcuts]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour46.md:117
msgid "You can now configure shortcuts more simply, and any shortcut conflicts are automatically detected."
msgstr "Podètz ara configurar dels acorchis, mai simplement, e los conflits d'acorchis son automaticament détectés."

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour46.md:119
msgid "Mouse settings"
msgstr "Paramètres de la mirga"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour46.md:121
msgid "![Mouse settings dialog][img-xfce4-mouse-settings]"
msgstr "![Fenèstra dels paramètres de la mirga][img-xfce4-mouse-settings]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour46.md:123
msgid "The **Mouse settings** dialog allows you to configure the different mice connected to your computer: button order, acceleration, double-click speed, mouse cursor theme, etcetera..."
msgstr "La fenèstra dels <b>paramètres de la mirga </b> vos permet de configurar las diferentas mirga connectadas a vòstre ordenador : l'òrdre dels botons, l'accélération, la vitesse del clic doble , lo tèma de curseur de mirga, etc ..."

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour46.md:125
msgid "Desktop settings"
msgstr "Paramètres del burèu"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour46.md:127
msgid "![Desktop settings dialog][img-xfdesktop-settings]"
msgstr "![Fenèstra dels paramètres de burèu][img-xfdesktop-settings]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour46.md:129
msgid "The **Desktop settings** dialog is now much more compact; it allows you to configure per-screen settings: wallpaper, brightness, desktop menu, displayed icons, etcetera..."
msgstr "La bóstia de dialòg dels <b>paramètres del burèu</b> es ara beaucoup mai compacte; elle vos permet de configurar los paramètres de l'ecran : fons d'ecran, luminositat, menú del burèu, icònas, etc ..."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour46.md:133
msgid "**Xfce 4.6** also comes with a brand new application finder which features a cleaner user interface. It is also easier to use it with the keyboard, and it monitors installed applications to update the list \"on the fly.\" It also allows you to create panel launchers quickly by dragging an application icon to the launcher creation window."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour46.md:135
msgid "![New application finder][img-xfce4-appfinder]"
msgstr "![Novèla recèrca d'aplicacion (finder)][img-xfce4-appfinder]"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/about/tour46.md:140
msgid "[Thunar website](https://xfce.org/projects/thunar)"
msgstr "[Site Web Thunar](https://xfce.org/projects/thunar)"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/about/tour46.md:144
msgid "Written by Jérôme Guelfucci (February 2009)"
msgstr "Escrich per Jérôme Guelfucci (Febrièr de 2009)"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/about/tour46.md:145
msgid "Screenshots by Jannis Pohlmann"
msgstr "Capturas d'ecran de Jannis Pohlmann"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/about/tour48.md:0
msgid "Xfce 4.8 tour"
msgstr "Visita Xfce 4.8"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour48.md:7
msgid "This tour will introduce you to all the new major visual features in Xfce 4.8. This is only the visual part of what has been done; for a full list of changes, see the [changelogs](/download/changelogs/)."
msgstr "Aquesta visita vous fera descobrir totas las novèlas caracteristicas majeures visualas dins Xfce 4.8. Ce n'est que la partie visible d'aqueste que es estada fait, per una lista completa dels modificacions, veire la [ liste dels cambiaments](/download/changelogs/)."

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour48.md:11
msgid "Remote shares browsing"
msgstr "Partages distants"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour48.md:13
msgid "Thunar now has optional support for GVFS which will allow you to browse remote shares using Thunar: FTP, Windows Shares, WebDav and SSH servers..."
msgstr "Thunar a ara un supòrt opcional per GVFS  que vos permetrà de percórrer los partiment s distants en utilizant Thunar : FTP, partiment Windows, WebDAV e servidors SSH ..."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour48.md:15
msgid "![Thunar browsing a remote share][img-thunar-remote]"
msgstr "![Thunar percor un partiment distant][img-thunar-remote]"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour48.md:17
msgid "New file operations progress dialog"
msgstr "Fenèstra de progression de las operacions Novèl fichièr"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour48.md:19
msgid "When several file operations (copy or move) are being handled in parallel, Thunar now shows a single progress dialog which displays all the relevant information."
msgstr "Quand mantuna operacion suls fichièrs (copiar o desplaçar) son tractadas en parallèl, Thunar aficha d'ara enlà una bóstia de dialòg de progression unica qu'aficha totas las informacions pertinentas."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour48.md:21
msgid "![Progress dialog][img-thunar-progress]"
msgstr "![Fenèstra Progression][img-thunar-progress]"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour48.md:23
msgid "Eject button for removable devices"
msgstr "Boton d'ejeccion pels periferics amovibles"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour48.md:25
msgid "It is is now possible to eject removable devices by clicking the eject button near each removable device label in the side pane."
msgstr "Es ara possible d'ejectar de periferics amovibles en clicant sul boton d'ejeccion prèp de l'etiqueta de cada periferic amovible dins lo panèl lateral."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour48.md:27
msgid "![Eject button][img-thunar-eject]"
msgstr "![Boton d'ejeccion][img-thunar-eject]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour48.md:31
msgid "The Xfce panel has been totally rewritten in 4.8, here are the most visible changes."
msgstr "Lo panèl Xfce es estada totalament reescrich dins 4.8, aquí los cambiaments los mai visibles."

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour48.md:33
msgid "Improved positioning and size handling"
msgstr "Melhorament de la manipulacion del posicionament e de la talha"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour48.md:35
msgid "The panel has much better support for positioning panels on the screen. It can be dragged and snapped to screen borders; floating positions are only remembered when moving a panel and the length of the panel can be adjusted as a percentage of the monitor size."
msgstr "Lo panèl a un melhor supòrt dels posicionaments dels panèls sus l'ecran. Pòt èsser desplaçat e se metre al bòrds de l'ecran, las posicions flotantas son solament rapeladas al moment del desplaçament del panèl e la longor del panèl pòt èsser ajustada en tant que percentatge de la talha de l'ecran."

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour48.md:37
msgid "Transparent backgrounds"
msgstr "Fons transparent"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour48.md:39
msgid "The panel is now able to draw transparent panel backgrounds with non transparent items. Your panel items will remain readable and you will enjoy a nice panel look."
msgstr "Lo panèl es ara en mesure de dessiner un panèl amb un fons transparent amb dels objets non transparents. Vos elements del panèl demoraràn lisibles e poiretz profiechar d'un look de panèl agréable."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour48.md:41
msgid "![Transparent panel background][img-panel-transparent]"
msgstr "![Fons del panèl transparent][img-panel-transparent]"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour48.md:43
msgid "New item editor"
msgstr "Novèl editor d'article"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour48.md:45
msgid "The panel now features an item editor which allows to modify, move, add and remove items quickly. This is particularly useful for items which are hard to right click and gives you an easy way to change your panel layout from a single place."
msgstr "Lo panèl dispausa d'ara enlà d'un editor d'element que permet de modificar, desplaçar, apondre e suprimir dels elements rapidament. Aquò es particulièrement utile pels elements que son difficiles a far amb un clic drech e vous donne un mejan aisit de changer la disposicion de votre panèl dempuèi un seul endroit."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour48.md:47
msgid "![Panel item editor][img-panel-editor]"
msgstr "![Editor d'element del panèl][img-panel-editor]"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour48.md:49
msgid "Drag and drop to create launchers"
msgstr "Glisser-depausar per crear d'aviadors"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour48.md:51
msgid "You can now drag and drop menu entries from the panel applications menu, application finder or Thunar to the panel to create launchers. This feature should please the huge number of people who had been requesting it for ages. The launcher also has an integrated application finder to add new items."
msgstr "Podètz ara lisar e depausar las entradas del menú del panèl aplicacions supportant menú, la lista d'aplicacion o Thunar dempuèi lo panèl per crear d'aviadors. Aquesta foncionalitat deuriá plaire al grand nombre de personas que avaient demandé aquò dempuèi longtemps. L'aviador a tanben un listeur d'aplicacion integrada per apondre de novèls elements."

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour48.md:53
msgid "Window buttons plugin"
msgstr "Botons de la fenèstra empeuton"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour48.md:55
msgid "The iconbox and tasklist plugins are new merged into 1 plugin, called window buttons. It implements different sorting modes, improved handling in vertical panels and can draw a similar frame as Xfwm4 Alt+tab when hovering a button."
msgstr "Los empeutons de la bóstia d’icòna e la lista dels prètzfaits an de novèl fusionat en 1 empeuton, apelat botons de fenèstra. Met en òbra diferents modes de tri, un melhor maniement dins los panèls verticals e pòt dessiner un quadre similar al Alt+tab de Xfwm4 al moment del susvòl d'un boton."

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour48.md:57
msgid "New fuzzy clock"
msgstr "Novèl relòtge fosca"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour48.md:59
msgid "An Xfce release without a new clock mode would not be a true Xfce release. Let us introduce you the 'fuzzy' clock mode!"
msgstr "Una version Xfce sens un novèl mòde de relòtge ne serait pas una vraie version de Xfce. Laissez-nous vous présenter lo mòde de relòtge 'fosc' !"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour48.md:61
msgid "![New fuzzy clock mode][img-panel-fuzzy-clock]"
msgstr "![Novèl mòde de relòtge fosc][img-panel-fuzzy-clock]"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour48.md:63
msgid "New directory menu plugin"
msgstr "Novèl repertòri menú empeuton "

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour48.md:65
msgid "The directory menu plugin provides a menu reproducing the arborescence of a particular folder. This allows you to open a terminal or a file manager in a sub-folder in a very fast and efficient way."
msgstr "L'empeuton menú repertòri prepausa un menú que reprodusís l'arborescéncia d'un dorsièr particular. Aquò vos permet de dobrir un terminal o d'un gestionari de fichièrs dins un sosdorsièr d'una manièra fòrça rapida e eficaça."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour48.md:67
msgid "![Directory menu plugin][img-panel-directorymenu]"
msgstr "![Repertòri menú empeuton][img-panel-directorymenu]"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour48.md:69
msgid "Applications menu edition"
msgstr "Edicion menú Aplicacions"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour48.md:71
msgid "You can now edit the applications menu using any Freedesktop compliant menu editor, Alacarte being the one we used to test."
msgstr "Podètz ara editar lo menú de las aplicacions en utilizant quin editor de menú que siá, compatible Freedesktop, Alacarte essent lo qu'avèm utilizat per testar."

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour48.md:75
msgid "Improved multihead setup configuration"
msgstr "Melhorament de la configuracion d'installacion multiecrans"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour48.md:77
msgid "Xfce can now handle and setup multihead setups for any randr 1.2 compatible driver. Unfortunately, this means it will not work with Nvidia proprietary drivers."
msgstr "Xfce pòt ara manipuler e configurar las configuracions multiecrans per n'importe quel pilòt compatible randr 1.2. Malheureusement, aquò significa que foncionarà pas amb los pilòts proprietaris Nvidia."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour48.md:79
msgid "You can enable and disable plugged screens, set their resolution, refresh rate, rotation and reflection, clone screens or extend desktops."
msgstr "Podètz activar e desactivar los ecrans brancats, fixer lor resolucion, lor taus de refrescament, la rotacion e la reflexion, cloner dels ecrans o de étendre los burèus."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour48.md:81
msgid "![New display settings dialog][img-display-settings]"
msgstr "![Novèla fenèstra dels paramètres d'afichatge][img-display-settings]"

#. type: Title ####
#: content/about/tour48.md:83
msgid "Timed confirmation"
msgstr "Confirmacion cronometrada"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour48.md:85
msgid "Any change made with the settings dialog will have to be confirmed within ten seconds or they will be reverted. This prevents broken video drivers from leaving your computer unusable."
msgstr "Toute modificacion aportada a la bóstia de dialòg dels reglatges devra èsser confirmada dins las dix segondas o ils seràn anullats. Aquò empêche los pilòts vidéo copats de quitar vòstre ordenador inutilizable."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour48.md:87
msgid "![Timed confirmation for display settings changes][img-display-settings-confirmation]"
msgstr "![Confirmacion cronometrat pel cambiament dels paramètres d'afichatge ][img-display-settings-confirmation]"

#. type: Title ####
#: content/about/tour48.md:89
msgid "Quick setup dialog"
msgstr "Fenèstra de configuracion rapide"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour48.md:91
msgid "The quick setup dialog allows you to configure a dual screen setup in a second. Plug the second screen, press the display key or Windows + p and select the wanted layout. Done!"
msgstr "La bóstia de dialòg de configuracion rapide vos permet de configurar una configuracion double ecran en una segonda. Brancatz lo segond ecran, quichatz sus la tòca ecran o Windows + p e seleccionatz la mesa en pagina desirada. Es fait !"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour48.md:93
msgid "![Quick multihead setup][img-minimal-display-settings]"
msgstr "![Installacion rapide multimonitor][img-minimal-display-settings]"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour48.md:95
msgid "Settings edition in the Xfce Settings Editor"
msgstr "Edicion Paramètres dins l'editor de paramètres Xfce"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour48.md:97
msgid "The Xfce Settings Editor now deserves its name, it is no longer a simpler Xfconf settings viewer. You can now modify, delete, add and reset settings through its interface. It also monitors changes to update its view."
msgstr "L'editor de paramètres Xfce mérite d'ara enlà son nom, il n'est mai un simple spectateur de paramètres xfconf. Podètz ara modificar, suprimir, apondre e reïnicializar los paramètres pel biais de son interfàcia. Il surveille tanben los cambiaments de metre a jorn son punt de vista."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour48.md:99
msgid "![Editing Xfconf properties with the Settings Editor][img-settings-editor]"
msgstr "![Edicion dels proprietats de Xfconf amb l'Editor de paramètres][img-settings-editor]"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour48.md:101
msgid "Improved keyboard layout selection"
msgstr "Melhorament de la seleccion de la configuracion del clavièr"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour48.md:103
msgid "The layout selection dialog received a lot of love: it no longer displays cryptic language/variants codes but uses localized languages/variants names. Layout edition was also made easier by prefilling the dialogs with the current values."
msgstr "La bóstia de dialòg de seleccion de la mesa en pagina a recebut fòrça atencion : aficha pas mai los còdis de lenga / variantas cryptiques mas utiliza de langages / variantas de noms localizats. La disposicion de l'édition a tanben été facilitée pel preemplenatge dels bóstia de dialòg amb las valors courantes."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour48.md:105
msgid "![Layouts and variants list][img-keyboard-settings-list]"
msgstr "![Organizacions e la lista dels variantas][img-keyboard-settings-list]"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/community/_index.md:0
msgid "Community"
msgstr "Comunautat"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/community/_index.md:6
msgid "Whether it be to solve a problem or to contribute in any way, the Xfce communities are a good place to get help or to share your ideas. You might also want to have a look at the communities of the different distributions which provide Xfce."
msgstr "Que siá per resòlvre un problèma o contribuir de quin biais que siá, las comunautats Xfce son un bon endrech per obténer d'ajuda o far part de vòstras idèas. Podètz tanben aver un agach sus las comunautats de las diferentas distribucions que provesisson Xfce."

#. type: Title ##
#: content/community/_index.md:8
msgid "Mailing lists"
msgstr "Listas de difusion"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/community/_index.md:10
msgid "Almost all development and coordination work is taking place on the Xfce mailing lists. A summary of all lists is available at [mail.xfce.org](https://mail.xfce.org). There is also a user-specific list where you can ask questions and freely discuss about the desktop."
msgstr "Gaireben tot lo trabalh de desvolopament e de coordinacion se debana sus las listas de difusion Xfce. Un resumit de totas las listas es disponible a l'adreça [mail.xfce.org](https://mail.xfce.org). Tanben i a una lista especifica pels utilizaires, ont podètz pausar de questions e discutir liurament sul burèu."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/community/_index.md:12
msgid "**NOTE:** In order to post to these lists, you must first subscribe."
msgstr "** REMARCA : ** Per postar sus aquelas listas, vos cal d'en primièr vos inscriure."

#. type: Title ##
#: content/community/_index.md:14
msgid "Matrix"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: content/community/_index.md:16
msgid "If you have a problem that you cannot resolve, you might want to try asking a question in our Matrix channel [#xfce](https://matrix.to/#/#xfce:matrix.org). The channel has several active users. It is recommended that you consult the [documentation](https://docs.xfce.org/) about your problem before asking your question."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: content/community/_index.md:18
msgid "Forums"
msgstr "Forums"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/community/_index.md:20
msgid "For users who prefer forums, the [Xfce Forum](https://forum.xfce.org/) is the place to be. Active contributors will be able to help you, but please do not use it for bug reports."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: content/community/_index.md:22
msgid "Social Networks"
msgstr "Rets Socialas"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/community/_index.md:24
msgid "You can follow us on the official [Mastodon account](https://floss.social/@xfce) or [Twitter account](https://twitter.com/xfceofficial)"
msgstr ""

#: content/download/_index.md:0
msgid "Download"
msgstr "Telecargar"

#: content/download/_index.md:7
msgid "Most distributions ship with Xfce in their own packaging format, but if you want a newer version or you want to build Xfce from scratch, you can find the packages below. [How to compile Xfce](https://docs.xfce.org/xfce/building)."
msgstr ""

#: content/download/_index.md:9
msgid "Stable release {{% version \"stable\" %}}"
msgstr "Version establa {{% version \"stable\" %}}"

#: content/download/_index.md:11
msgid "Xfce {{% version \"stable\" %}} is the most recent version of the Xfce desktop environment. [Changes in this release](/download/changelogs/{{% version \"stable\" %}})."
msgstr ""

#: content/download/_index.md:13
#, fuzzy
msgid "<https://archive.xfce.org/xfce/{{% version \"stable\" %}}/>"
msgstr "[Telecargar](http://archive.xfce.org/xfce/4.8pre3/)"

#: content/download/_index.md:15
msgid "Individual releases"
msgstr "Versions individualas"

#: content/download/_index.md:17
msgid "Each package in Xfce can make individual stable or development releases, including the core packages (as described in the [release model](https://docs.xfce.org/contribute/dev/make-a-platform-release#making_a_platform_release)). You can follow the announcements of the releases on the [Xfce users mailing list](/community), watch the [release feeds](https://archive.xfce.org/feeds/project/) or follow the Xfce [Mastodon](https://floss.social/@xfce) or [Twitter account](https://twitter.com/xfceofficial)."
msgstr ""

#: content/download/_index.md:19
#, fuzzy
msgid "<https://archive.xfce.org/src/>"
msgstr "[Telecargar](http://archive.xfce.org/xfce/4.6.2/)"

#: content/download/_index.md:22
msgid "Preview release {{% version \"preview\" %}}"
msgstr "Version preliminària {{% version \"preview\" %}}"

#: content/download/_index.md:24
msgid "Xfce {{% version \"preview\" %}} is the latest development release of the Xfce desktop environment. This release should not be used in a production environments. If you are uncertain about downloading this release, you should probably use the [stable release](#stable) above. [Changes in this release](/download/changelogs/{{% version \"preview\" %}})."
msgstr ""

#: content/download/_index.md:26
#, fuzzy
msgid "<https://archive.xfce.org/xfce/{{% version \"preview\" %}}/>"
msgstr "[Telecargar](http://archive.xfce.org/xfce/4.8pre3/)"

#: content/download/_index.md:30
msgid "Distributions"
msgstr "Distribucions"

#: content/download/_index.md:32
msgid "A lot of different distributions provide Xfce packages. Popular examples built around Xfce are [Xubuntu](https://xubuntu.org/), the [Fedora Xfce Spin](https://fedoraproject.org/spins/xfce), [Manjaro](https://manjaro.org/products/download/) or [Zenwalk](http://www.zenwalk.org/), but there is a good chance your favorite distro provides packages as well."
msgstr ""

#: content/download/_index.md:34
msgid "You can find a more complete list at [DistroWatch.com](https://distrowatch.com/search.php?pkg=xfdesktop&pkgver={{% version \"stable\" %}})."
msgstr ""

#: content/download/_index.md:36
msgid "Artwork"
msgstr "Illustracions"

#: content/download/_index.md:38
msgid "[Download the Xfce artwork tarball](//cdn.xfce.org/downloads/xfce_artwork.tar.bz2). It contains some high-quality logos and banners. Copying of the Xfce logo is subject to the LGPL copyright license."
msgstr ""

#: content/download/changelogs/_index.md:0
msgid "Changelogs"
msgstr ""

#: content/download/changelogs/_index.md:7
msgid "Xfce release notes are specific to each version. Select your version from the list below to see the changes in the release."
msgstr "Las nòtas de version Xfce son especificas a cada version. Seleccionatz vòstra version dins la lista çaijós per veire los cambiaments dins la version."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/getinvolved/_index.md:0
msgid "Get Involved"
msgstr "S'implicar"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/getinvolved/_index.md:6
msgid "Welcome to the Xfce community. By joining our team, you will be part of an international effort by hundreds of people working to deliver a stunning Free Software computing experience. You will meet new friends, learn new skills and make a difference to millions of users while working with people from all around the globe. There are many different ways you can become part of this, just read on and pick an area which interests you or seems challenging."
msgstr "Benvenguda dins la comunautat Xfce. En rejonhent nòstre equipa, faretz partida d'un esfòrç internacional de centenats de personas que trabalhan per ofrir una supèrba experiéncia informatica del logicial liure. Anatz rencontrar d'amics novèls, aprene de novèlas competéncias e far una diferéncia per de milions d'utilizaires, tot en trabalhant amb de monde de pertot dins lo mond. I a fòrça biaisses diferents per aquò far, Sufís de legir e de causir un domeni que vos interèssa o sembla estimulant."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/getinvolved/_index.md:8
msgid "Possible tasks include testing, bug reporting; writing code, developing artwork, documentation or translations; or spreading the word and helping out with promotion and marketing both on line and at tradeshows and conferences."
msgstr "Los prètzfaits possibles comprenon los tèsts, los rapòrts de bugs, l'escritura de còdi, la creacion artistica, icòna, fonses d’ecran, tèmas, la documentacion o las traduccions, o encara presicar la bona paraula e ajudar per la promocion e lo marketing a l'encòp en linha e a de salons comenercials e de conferéncias."

#. type: Title ##
#: content/getinvolved/_index.md:10
msgid "Documentation"
msgstr "Documentacion"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/getinvolved/_index.md:12
msgid "There's lots of people using and testing Xfce. By providing useful and up-to-date documentation, you will make a big impact on helping people understand how to make the most of the Xfce Desktop Environment. [Learn More →](https://docs.xfce.org/contribute/documentation)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: content/getinvolved/_index.md:14
msgid "Translation"
msgstr "Traduccion"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/getinvolved/_index.md:16
msgid "Are you fluent in multiple languages? By contributing your translations of text to the Xfce Desktop Environment, you will help Xfce be a better part of the global market and more accessible to the millions of potential users out there. [Learn More →](https://docs.xfce.org/contribute/translate/start)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: content/getinvolved/_index.md:18
msgid "Development"
msgstr "Desvolopament"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/getinvolved/_index.md:20
msgid "By becoming a developer, you can make a big difference while enjoying a challenging and fun experience. You'll learn to be a better coder, you will get to implement new features and defeat daunting bugs, creating a stunning product, all the while collaborating with people from all around the world. You can start by browsing the [source code](https://gitlab.xfce.org)."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: content/getinvolved/_index.md:22
msgid "Promotion"
msgstr "Promocion"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/getinvolved/_index.md:24
msgid "If you own a blog or website you can greatly help by spreading the word and encouraging new users to give Xfce a try. If you have a Mastodon or Twitter account you can also help by reposting any announcements we make to help us reach a larger audience."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: content/getinvolved/_index.md:26
msgid "Bug Reporting and testing"
msgstr "Rapòrts de bug e tèsts"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/getinvolved/_index.md:28
msgid "One of the most useful tasks that we rely on the community for is testing and reporting of bugs. Since Xfce runs on various platform and in a lot of different setups, testing all changes in every possible situation is an impossible task. As such we kindly ask users to assist in testing, and reporting all bugs they may find, using our [bug tracker](https://gitlab.xfce.org)."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: content/getinvolved/_index.md:30
msgid "Once a bug has been found, the cause of the bug needs to be tracked down, and then (obviously) fixed. If you want to get involved in the actual development process of Xfce a great way to start is by solving bugs and then submitting a patch file."
msgstr "Un còp qu'un bug es estat trobat, la causa de l'anomalia deu èsser tracada, puèi (evidentament) corregida. Se volètz vos implicar dins lo processus de desvolopament real de Xfce, un excellent biais de començar es de resòlvre los bugs e puèi de sometre un fichièr patch."

#. type: Title ##
#: content/getinvolved/_index.md:32
msgid "OpenCollective"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: content/getinvolved/_index.md:34
msgid "If you want to fund the project, you can use OpenCollective. Xfce has created two collectives, known as [Xfce ($)](https://opencollective.com/xfce) and [Xfce-Eu (€)](https://opencollective.com/xfce-eu) respectively. [Learn More →](https://mail.xfce.org/pipermail/xfce/2021-May/037348.html)"
msgstr ""

#: content/projects/_index.md:0
msgid "Projects"
msgstr ""

#: content/projects/_index.md:7
msgid "The Xfce project contains several separated projects for each part of the desktop. Some projects have their own project pages to provide additional information."
msgstr ""
